WEBVTT

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.990
Our next opponent is Team Ragnarok.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:12.640
They're duelists who have 
the power of the gods.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.550
Dragan, Brave and their leader Harald.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.200
Yes.  Their skills are 
number one in the world.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.080
They're a powerful foe.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:29.970
But in order to stop Iliaster's plans, we must 
defeat Team Ragnarok and advance to the finals.

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:32.860
We can't afford to lose.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.230
My Red Dragon Archfiend will annihilate 
the three Aesir this time!

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:41.790
Jack and Crow, let's make 
our final adjustments.

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:42.520
Yeah!

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:43.580
I'll drive fast!

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:58.340
It's what you were talking about, Harald.

00:00:58.340 --> 00:00:59.130
Yeah.

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:02.580
A threat approaches this world.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:16.250
That again.

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:17.640
I see it.

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:27.030
It seems we're not the 
only ones who can see it.

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:42.250
What's with their eyes?

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:46.690
I can feel their eyes 
resonating with our marks.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.620
So you have the marks of the Crimson Dragon.

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:52.490
Your symbols are impressive, but...

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:55.090
You're not equal to our power.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:57.620
This eye is a Rune Eye.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:00.680
Rune Eye?

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:04.950
It seems the shockwaves didn't affect you.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.170
Shockwaves?

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:08.750
Shockwaves that alter time and space.

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:12.490
A large threat is coming to this world.

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:16.330
That thing is an omen.

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:18.930
It's bringing Fimbulwinter.

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:21.040
Fimbulwinter?

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:26.750
Yes.  It's an omen for Ragnarok, 
Norse mythology's final battle.

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:29.950
You know what that is?

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.830
No, we don't know for certain.

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:37.960
But we believe it has strong 
ties with Team New World, the

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:42.660
team that appeared after the 
shockwaves changed time and space.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:44.310
Team New World!

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:48.910
They're working behind-the-scenes 
to destroy the world.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:57.060
With our Rune Eyes, it's 
our mission to defeat them.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:01.280
Riding Duels.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:04.420
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:11.260
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:32.490
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:42.600
Soar in the infinite skies   BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:48.840
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:54.780
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:03:55.310 --> 00:04:00.550
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:06.160
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:12.530
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:18.300
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:24.640
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:30.920
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:04:55.140 --> 00:05:00.850
Duelists with the Rune Eyes

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:07.260
The Rune Eyes show that we inherited 
the power of the three Aesir.

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:13.550
I'll teach you about the 
power of our three Aesir.

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:18.410
It's said that the three Aesir 
Cards have the power of the gods.

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:24.480
The three Aesir are cards that have been 
passed down since the mythological age.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.110
There are three cards.

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:31.690
One card has been passed down 
through my family from long ago.

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:36.480
Legend says that when a 
threat approaches this

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:40.380
world, the true power of the 
three Aesir will awaken.

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:57.150
Captain, I'm in trouble!

00:05:57.860 --> 00:05:59.670
All the instruments are malfunctioning!

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:00.730
What?

00:06:02.510 --> 00:06:05.370
I see.  Is it due to the shockwave?

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:07.650
Captain, at this rate-

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.050
Gain altitude immediately!

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:15.240
Yes, but...

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:18.220
Rise immediately!  You're going to crash!

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:22.160
Gods, lend me your power!

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:35.280
Harald, why did you fire 
missiles without permission?

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:37.940
Don't you dare complain 
about your punishment!

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:39.460
I don't care.

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:42.140
I was thinking about retiring.

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:44.420
What?  Why?

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.840
In order to protect the world.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:50.910
You think you can protect freedom 
without working for the military?

00:06:55.570 --> 00:07:00.480
We'll be fighting a menace 
that weapons can't defeat.

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:03.260
Wait, Harald!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:06.220
What do you mean?  I don't understand!

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:07.870
Why would someone as skilled as you-

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.280
Harald!

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:23.230
When Fimbulwinter arrives, the 
people lose their morale and die.

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:30.020
The ones who will cause 
this have finally arrived.

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:32.190
It's time.

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:37.940
So you're leaving to find the final two.

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:41.140
I was given that mission.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:45.780
There must be others who have 
the same Rune Eye as me.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:51.290
In that case, I created a list of candidates.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.390
Impressive as always, Sebastian.

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:09.710
It's true?  You're one of the 
inheritors of the three Aesir?

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:19.320
I need the Thor card that 
you excavated and its power.

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:22.520
It seems you're the real thing.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:24.590
Can you open that for me?

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:34.000
This is Thor, Lord of the Aesir.

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:40.990
My son left that card, along 
with his duelist pride.

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:50.330
My son is in the mountains, 
as if he's wishing for death.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:56.010
Please give that card back to Dragan!

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:02.180
Please get back his pride!

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.640
Okay.  I promise.

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:10.880
Don't do anything crazy, Dragan!

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:12.870
That route is dangerous!

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:18.360
Stop!  It's too dangerous!

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:22.790
He's out of his mind.  I can't deal with him.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.420
No way!

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:50.590
Since you're protected by the Rune 
Eye's power, you can't die easily.

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:53.070
Rune Eye?

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:57.160
Use its power and battle beside me.

00:09:58.170 --> 00:10:00.150
Who are you?

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:07.820
I'm Harald.  I've inherited Odin, Father of 
the Aesir, which is one of the three Aesir Cards.

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:21.760
Dragan, you're the owner 
of Thor, Lord of the Aesir.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:24.060
You're wrong!

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:27.750
I threw away my pride as a duelist!

00:10:28.110 --> 00:10:31.750
I don't have the right to have that card.

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:37.430
Your father in the hospital and 
this card want you to have it.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:46.690
Dragan, battle using Thor, Lord of the Aesir.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:51.660
And get back your duelist's soul.

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:54.360
That is your destiny.

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:57.330
You cannot escape it.

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:12.230
You must be a curious person because you're 
searching for treasure in a remote location.

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:16.330
This place is known for pirates.

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:24.210
I'm scared, so I'll wait outside.

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:26.220
Go on ahead, Mister.

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:58.590
It's Loki, the third Aesir Card.

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:06.940
Pirates aren't the only ones who want it!

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:10.500
I, Brave, will take this treasured card!

00:12:14.030 --> 00:12:15.500
That was too easy.

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:26.090
He had accomplices?

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:30.470
But only locals can pass through this 
area because it's full of rocks.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.400
You'll die!

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.870
Dragan, show him our power!

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:44.840
What?

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:46.490
Oh no!

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.520
This must be a joke!

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:18.640
Fine!  I'll give this card back!

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:27.090
Brave, you're meant to have that 
Loki, Lord of the Aesir card.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:28.210
What?

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:33.380
Brave, lend me your strength.

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:41.470
If we assemble the three Aesir, 
we can face the upcoming threat.

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:45.240
The three Aesir?

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:47.430
See with your own eyes!

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:53.250
The three Aesir will now resurrect 
from the mythological world!

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:58.840
What do you mean?

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:32.480
The three Aesir have the power to 
hold up the Scandinavian skies.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:39.790
We must use that power to protect 
the world from the upcoming threat.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:41.920
Protect the world from a threat?

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:45.300
Team New World holds the key.

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:51.110
Therefore, we will solve the mystery 
when we defeat them in the finals.

00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:54.820
Is that why you entered the tournament?

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:57.310
In that case, we have the same goal.

00:14:57.590 --> 00:14:59.280
Let's work together.

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:06.570
The three Aesir Cards 
don't consider you allies.

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:07.560
What?

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:12.930
Your father Professor 
Fudo caused Zero Reverse.

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:18.750
Since you're part of his bloodline, 
you have a destiny of destruction.

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:21.310
That's not true!

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:23.230
I want to protect this city!

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:27.980
The upcoming battle will make that clear.

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:31.090
How dare they accuse us!

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:32.930
We don't need to team up with them.

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:36.390
As always, you have the 
pride of a first-class snob.

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:37.570
What?

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:43.560
Jack Atlas, do you know why I challenged 
you to an exhibition match?

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:47.010
No, I don't.

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:51.510
You may not remember, but 
I've never forgotten!

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:52.900
What?

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:54.680
It was three years ago!

00:15:56.920 --> 00:16:02.220
I planned to head out into the 
world to hone my dueling skills.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:09.140
But in order to do that, I needed to acquire 
the most powerful cards to battle with.

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:14.070
They were the three Aesir Cards.

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:18.510
Just when I found the Thor card...

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:33.710
Due to the cave-in, my father was 
severely injured and nearly dead.

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:39.480
In order to save my father's life, I needed 
lots of money to pay the medical bills.

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:44.270
But I didn't have much money.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.490
That's when...

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:53.190
I'll be Jack Atlas's opponent?

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:58.620
But they weren't looking 
for just an opponent.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.100
Out of the way!

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:01.600
Jack!  Jack Atlas!

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:02.870
Any comment?

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:04.590
Master Atlas, this way.

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:15.500
They were grooming Jack Atlas to become 
the King, so they wanted me to be a patsy.

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:20.270
Director Godwin has just one stipulation.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:24.510
You must not defeat Jack.  Understood?

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:29.830
As long as I obey, I'll get 
the money to save my father.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:33.220
My father who always supported me!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:38.020
That's the moment I sold my duelist pride.

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:42.900
No way!  Godwin forced you to be a patsy?

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:49.370
Did you really think that you became 
King due to your own abilities?

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:53.980
Recall the duel!

00:17:56.090 --> 00:18:01.320
King Jack Atlas's challenger is the 
Scandinavian grim reaper Dragan!

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:03.990
What duel will they show us?

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:06.340
Duel!

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.110
My turn!

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:11.850
I summon the Tuner Monster Top Runner!

00:18:15.230 --> 00:18:17.810
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.500
He's no King.

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:23.570
He's a fake who's only here to draw a crowd!

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:26.820
But I have to lose against him...

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:34.550
Even if you're the Scandinavian grim reaper, 
you're a powerless sheep against the King!

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:37.160
My turn!

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:40.990
I summon Garmr of the Nordic Beasts!

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:49.840
I set one card and end my turn!

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:55.200
You have a weak monster in 
attack position and a set card?

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:58.950
Cheap tricks won't work against the King!

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:02.140
I'll show you the power of the hunted!

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:03.630
My turn!

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:07.680
I summon Power Breaker from my hand!

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:15.790
Level 4 Top Runner tunes 
Level 4 Power Breaker!

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:19.810
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:22.320
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:24.230
Synchro Summon!

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:28.310
My soul!  Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:31.260
That's why Jack Atlas is the King!

00:19:31.260 --> 00:19:35.820
He already summoned his ace 
monster Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:37.040
All right, King!

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:39.400
That's why you're Jack Atlas!  You're cool!

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:43.010
He summoned his ace monster very quickly.

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:46.640
So he's not just a puppet.

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:48.390
I want to win.

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:50.330
I can win!

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:54.250
I'll win if I use this trap card!

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:57.070
I...

00:19:57.070 --> 00:20:01.670
Do you understand your agreement 
with Director Godwin?

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:07.710
Are you planning to break your 
agreement with Director Godwin?

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:14.310
You'll learn about the King's skills!

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:18.190
Red Dragon Archfiend attacks 
Garmr of the Nordic Beasts!

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:21.390
Absolute Powerforce!

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:25.870
Damn!

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:48.420
Now I remember!

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:52.660
I won because of Godwin?

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:55.440
You expect me to believe your lies?

00:20:55.650 --> 00:21:00.150
If I used my trump card, 
I wouldn't have lost.

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:01.830
You're all talk!

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:05.840
Jack Atlas, it's time for us 
to settle our differences!

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:08.310
I'm looking forward to it.

00:21:08.310 --> 00:21:13.310
I'll defeat you again and 
crush your arrogance!

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:28.010
Tomorrow is WRGP's true final battle!

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:33.400
The winner of the duel will battle Iliaster!

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:36.080
We also can't afford to lose!

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:39.450
Let's settle this, Team Ragnarok!

00:21:51.260 --> 00:21:56.630
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:21:57.100 --> 00:22:03.330
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you

00:22:16.280 --> 00:22:21.590
You always pretend and hide your fears

00:22:21.920 --> 00:22:27.230
You act tough and don't listen to anyone

00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:32.830
You do this over and over

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:38.540
I shouted until my soul would break

00:22:38.800 --> 00:22:43.940
Hurry up and throw that away

00:22:44.480 --> 00:22:51.450
We're only heading towards tomorrow

00:22:51.880 --> 00:22:57.190
Close to you   If you're 
trying to find yourself

00:22:57.590 --> 00:23:03.030
Just keep doing what you ultimately decided

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:08.470
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:23:08.970 --> 00:23:16.570
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you
